  ],
  "steps": [
    "Preheat oven to 180\u00b0C / 350\u00b0F. Whisk cream cheese, yogurt, sweetener, eggs and protein powder until smooth.",
    "Line a 22\u00d718cm (9\u00d77in) baking dish; bake 35\u201345 minutes. Cool 20 minutes.",
    "Melt dark chocolate with milk and cornstarch in a small pan on medium-low, stirring until thick and creamy.",
    "Spread chocolate sauce over cheesecake, then pistachio butter. Top with chopped pistachios.",
    "Refrigerate at least 4 hours or overnight."
  ],
